  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARTF - Microfinance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to (i) help the population of the Recipient#s territory to (A) improve their livelihoods, (B) make the transition from dependence on humanitarian assistance to economic independence, and (C) empower them to build on their entrepreneurial spirit and skills; (ii) provide to low-income people, through existing microfinance facilities, a range of financial services such as (A) income-generating and enterprise loans, (B) saving services, and (C) consumer loans; and (iii) establish the foundations of a strong and sustainable microfinance sector.</narrative>
  </description>
